# Admin data table pattern (`adt-*`)

Use for **list/table** pages. Include surface styles when the page has a header or stats row.

## Setup

```blade
<x-admin.surface-styles />
<x-admin.data-table-styles />

<div class="main-content admin-data-table">
```

## Class reference

See `admin-surfaces.mdc` for `ads-*` (header, stats). Table-specific:

| Area | Classes |
|------|---------|
| Panel | `adt-panel`, `adt-toolbar`, `adt-filters`, `adt-search`, `adt-select` |
| Table | `adt-table-wrap`, `adt-table`, `adt-th-sortable`, `adt-th-actions` |
| Cells | `adt-user-cell`, `adt-avatar`, `adt-tag`, `adt-muted`, `adt-status-*` |
| Actions | `adt-actions`, `adt-action-btn`, `adt-action-danger` |
| Footer | `adt-footer`, `adt-pagination` |
| Empty | `adt-empty`, `adt-empty-icon`, `adt-empty-title` |

## Reference

`resources/views/livewire/admin/manage-users.blade.php`

## Rules

- Page header/stats use **ads-***, table body uses **adt-***.
- Pagination: `{{ $paginator->links('pagination::bootstrap-5') }}` inside `adt-pagination`.

## Portable kit

`admin-ui-kit/` or `admin-data-table-kit/` in repo root.
